      "id": "claim_dcd8f0fd85124db0bb39a6cf7b5a4969",
      "statement": "FeedService.subscribe performs an unconditional FeedFetcher.fetch(url), parses the result with FeedParser (which throws FeedParseException, mapped to 422, when the parse yields no title and no articles), saves a new Feed with pollIntervalMinutes from myfeeder.polling.default-interval-minutes, and publishes FeedSavedEvent(saved); FeedService.update also publishes FeedSavedEvent after a title/interval change, re-registering the feed's schedule through the same event path.",
