    {
      "id": "claim_32b5d86366ad44e38dcef11076f2b337",
      "statement": "FeedPollingService.pollFeed performs a conditional fetch via FeedFetcher.fetch(url, etag, lastModifiedHeader); a 304 response only updates lastPolledAt and returns, a 200 response re-parses the feed and inserts only articles where articleRepository.existsByFeedIdAndGuid(feedId, guid) is false, and on success resets errorCount to 0, clears lastError, and updates lastSuccessfulPollAt, while any exception increments errorCount, records lastError, and is swallowed (logged, not rethrown) rather than propagated.",
      "evidence": [
