      "statement": "After a successful poll inserts new articles, FeedPollingService.publishIngested publishes ArticlesIngestedEvent(feedId, newIds) (skipped when there are no new ids); this publish runs after the success bookkeeping is saved and inside its own try/catch so a scoring-side failure can never be mistaken for a poll failure, since pollFeed has no surrounding transaction and the listener runs inline.",
