    },
    {
      "id": "claim_428acb0b33184670bc4d44653cfdb5cd",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher returns the raw response body bytes plus the Content-Type header in FetchResult without decoding text itself, and also supports conditional requests (If-None-Match/If-Modified-Since) that short-circuit to FetchResult.notModified304() on a 304 response; charset resolution for feed bodies happens afterward in FeedParser (explicit header charset, else BOM/XML-prolog detection via ROME's XmlReader, else UTF-8), not in FeedFetcher.",
